OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785167295
OL,3,CMurder probe launched after
OL,4,Cmotorcyclist dies in collision with
OL,5,CMercedes
OL,7,FThe motorbike rider died and the
OL,8,Fscene, and police say his next of kin
OL,9,Fhas been informed.
OL,11,FAt 9.50pm an 18 year old man attended
OL,12,FCanterbury police station voluntarily
OL,13,Fand was arrested in connection with
OL,14,Fthe incident.
OL,16,FHe's been released on bail.
OL,18,FThe following day, a 19 year old man
OL,19,Fattended Canterbury Police station and
OL,20,Fwas also arrested in connection with
OL,21,Fthe incident.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
