FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785167295
OL,3,CMurder probe launched after
OL,4,Cmotorcyclist dies in collision with
OL,5,CMercedes
OL,7,FConnor Todd, of Portlight Place,
OL,8,FSeasalter, has since been charged with
OL,9,Fmurder and will appear before Margate
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court tomorrow. (28 July)
OL,12,FA Kent Police spokesperson said:
OL,13,F"Enquiries to establish the
OL,14,Fcircumstances are ongoing and officers
OL,15,Fare appealing for witnesses or anyone
OL,16,Fwith dashcam, doorbell or mobile phone
OL,17,Ffootage of either vehicle before or
OL,18,Fafter the collision to come forward.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
